{"2644590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Global Magnates: Shipping Tycoon", "steam_appid": 2644590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4256640], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Empire, Outsmart the Competition</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a full 3D Globe, compete against AI-driven rival companies that will challenge your rise through takeovers, acquisitions, or price wars. Stay ahead by acquiring key ports, expanding your fleet, investing in shipyards, and making savvy economic moves. Outsmart opponents by mastering global trade, logistics, and dynamic market trends.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced AI competitors with takeover strategies and market pressure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic business environment where every move counts </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644590/extras/ef9c716abf1cf9bf0495651a8ea641ad.poster.avif?t=1766083156\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644590/extras/ef9c716abf1cf9bf0495651a8ea641ad.webm?t=1766083156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644590/extras/ef9c716abf1cf9bf0495651a8ea641ad.mp4?t=1766083156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deep Simulation &amp; Global Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage every aspect of your shipping business from purchasing vessels and designing routes to balancing regional demand and responding to economic events. Plan profitable trade lanes, allocate resources wisely, and react to changing economies to become a logistics powerhouse.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full-scale management of ships, routes, ports, and resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Responsive economic systems that reflect global and local trends</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644590/extras/cf94f45899e03b034073bfe9d7d26215.poster.avif?t=1766083156\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644590/extras/cf94f45899e03b034073bfe9d7d26215.webm?t=1766083156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644590/extras/cf94f45899e03b034073bfe9d7d26215.mp4?t=1766083156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cargo or Containers? Your Fleet, Your Command</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between customizable cargo ships and efficient container vessels. Optimize each ship's route and speed to maximize profits. As your business grows, build a diverse portfolio of assets from cutting-edge technology and capital to reputation and financial reserves.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple ship classes with distinct advantages and customization options</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asset growth system including tech, capital, reputation, and infrastructure</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644590/extras/b584c454b650405433ff6e0dc9bdc219.poster.avif?t=1766083156\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644590/extras/b584c454b650405433ff6e0dc9bdc219.webm?t=1766083156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644590/extras/b584c454b650405433ff6e0dc9bdc219.mp4?t=1766083156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The World is Yours to Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Sandbox Mode, shape the game your way. Tweak the settings, experiment with trading strategies, and build your dream fleet while exploring hundreds of ports worldwide.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore hundreds of ports across the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock all ship customizations to create the ultimate trading fleet</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644590/extras/a1b3dea200203bf97c5afcf4af21ea3c.poster.avif?t=1766083156\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644590/extras/a1b3dea200203bf97c5afcf4af21ea3c.webm?t=1766083156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644590/extras/a1b3dea200203bf97c5afcf4af21ea3c.mp4?t=1766083156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mod-Friendly with Steam Workshop Support</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your game, modify ships, ports, economic parameters, or create entirely new gameplay experiences that will put the limits of your creativity to test.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive modding tools are available for you to create your dream scenario</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share easily with your friends and community through the Steam Workshop</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Empire, Outsmart the Competition</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a full 3D Globe, compete against AI-driven rival companies that will 